  "why_superseded": "the sibling mode took B as the next heads after A and required B in A's arena; A was the last free head of its arena, so no B in 4096 newSViv was, and the mode ended before any access (no probe announced) on both arms. Changed to take A and B as two consecutive heads that share an arena. The other three modes gave the same outcomes as both measured rounds."
